---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="PostgreSQL CDC Source"
  description="PostgreSQL change data capture (CDC) source connector over logical decoding (pgoutput) in krabka-connect."
  currentSlug="/docs/connect-postgres"
>
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-4xl">PostgreSQL CDC Source</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2 text-base">
        Stream database change logs over logical decoding directly into Kafka topics via <code class="text-krab-300 font-mono text-xs">crabka-connect-postgres</code>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-gray-300">
      <p>
        <code class="font-mono text-krab-300">crabka-connect-postgres</code> reads WAL records via PostgreSQL's <code class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-200">pgoutput</code> plugin, providing lock-free table snapshotting and exact transaction boundary propagation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
